{"page":491,"verses":[{"verse_key":"43:23","surah":43,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ مَآ أَرْسَلْنَا مِن قَبْلِكَ فِى قَرْيَةٍ مِّن نَّذِيرٍ إِلَّا قَالَ مُتْرَفُوهَآ إِنَّا وَجَدْنَآ ءَابَآءَنَا عَلَىٰٓ أُمَّةٍ وَإِنَّا عَلَىٰٓ ءَاثَـٰرِهِم مُّقْتَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When-ever We sent a messenger before you to warn a township, those corrupted by wealth said, in the same way, ‘We saw our fathers following this tradition; we are only following in their footsteps.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And thus","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَبْلِكَ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablika","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَرْيَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"a town","transliteration":"qaryatin","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نَّذِيرٍ","en_gloss":"warner","transliteration":"nadhīrin","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُتْرَفُوهَآ","en_gloss":"(the) wealthy ones of it","transliteration":"mut'rafūhā","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, we","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَجَدْنَآ","en_gloss":"[we] found","transliteration":"wajadnā","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ءَابَآءَنَا","en_gloss":"our forefathers","transliteration":"ābāanā","verse_key":"43:23"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_