,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"with what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"43:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أُرْسِلْتُم","en_gloss":"you are sent","transliteration":"ur'sil'tum","verse_key":"43:24"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"with [it]","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"43:24"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَـٰفِرُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) disbelievers","transliteration":"kāfirūna","verse_key":"43:24"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:24"}]},{"verse_key":"43:25","surah":43,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"فَٱنتَقَمْنَا مِنْهُمْ ۖ فَٱنظُرْ كَيْفَ كَانَ عَـٰقِبَةُ ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We punished them: think about how those who rejected the Truth met their end.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَٱنتَقَمْنَا","en_gloss":"So We took retribution","transliteration":"fa-intaqamnā","verse_key":"43:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"43:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَٱنظُرْ","en_gloss":"Then see","transliteration":"fa-unẓur","verse_key":"43:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَيْفَ","en_gloss":"how","transliteration":"kayfa","verse_key":"43:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"43:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","en_gloss":"(the) end","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","verse_key":"43:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the deniers","transliteration":"l-mukadhibīna","verse_key":"43:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٢٥","en_gloss":"(25)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:25"}]},{"verse_key":"43:26","surah":43,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ قَالَ إِبْرَٰهِيمُ لِأَبِيهِ وَقَوْمِهِۦٓ إِنَّنِى بَرَآءٌ مِّمَّا تَعْبُدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Abraham said to his father and his people, ‘I renounce what you worship.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"43:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim Said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"43:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِيمُ","en_gloss":"Ibrahi