{"pos":3,"ar":"بَاقِيَةًۭ","en_gloss":"lasting","transliteration":"bāqiyatan","verse_key":"43:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"43:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَقِبِهِۦ","en_gloss":"his descendents","transliteration":"ʿaqibihi","verse_key":"43:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may","transliteration":"laʿallahum","verse_key":"43:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَرْجِعُونَ","en_gloss":"return","transliteration":"yarjiʿūna","verse_key":"43:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٢٨","en_gloss":"(28)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:28"}]},{"verse_key":"43:29","surah":43,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"بَلْ مَتَّعْتُ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ وَءَابَآءَهُمْ حَتَّىٰ جَآءَهُمُ ٱلْحَقُّ وَرَسُولٌ مُّبِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"I have let these people and their fathers enjoy long lives, and now I have given them the Truth and a messenger to make things clear-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"43:29"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَتَّعْتُ","en_gloss":"I gave enjoyment","transliteration":"mattaʿtu","verse_key":"43:29"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","en_gloss":"(to) these","transliteration":"hāulāi","verse_key":"43:29"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَءَابَآءَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and their forefathers","transliteration":"waābāahum","verse_key":"43:29"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"43:29"},{"pos":6,"ar":"جَآءَهُمُ","en_gloss":"came to them","transliteration":"jāahumu","verse_key":"43:29"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْحَقُّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","verse_key":"43:29"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَرَسُولٌۭ","en_gloss":"and a Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlun","verse_key":"43:29"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مُّبِينٌۭ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"mubīnun","verse_key":"43:29"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٢٩","en_gloss":"(29)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:29"}]},{"verse_key":"43:30","surah":43,"ayah":30,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا جَآءَهُمُ ٱلْحَقُّ قَالُوا۟ هَـٰذَا سِحْرٌ وَإِنَّا بِهِۦ كَـٰفِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"yet when the Truth came to them, they said, ‘This is sorcery. We do not believe in it,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"walammā","verse_key":"43:30"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَهُمُ","en_gloss":"came to them","transliteration":"jāahumu","verse_key":"43:30"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْحَقُّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","verse_key":"43:30"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"43:30"},{"pos":5,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"This","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"43:30"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سِحْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) magic","transliteration":"siḥ'run","verse_key":"43:30"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَإِنَّا","en_gloss":"and indeed, we","transliteration":"wa-innā","verse_key":"43:30"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"of it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"43:30"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَـٰفِرُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) disbelievers","transliteration":"kāfirūna","verse_key":"43:30"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٣٠","en_gloss":"(30)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:30"}]},{"verse_key":"43:31","surah":43,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟ لَوْلَا نُزِّلَ هَـٰذَا ٱلْقُرْءَانُ عَلَىٰ رَجُلٍ مِّنَ ٱلْقَرْيَتَيْنِ عَظِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and they said, ‘Why was this Quran not sent down to a distinguished man, from either of the two cities?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they say","transliteration":"waqālū","verse_key":"43:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَوْلَا","en_gloss":"Why not","transliteration":"lawlā","verse_key":"43:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نُزِّلَ","en_gloss":"was sent down","transliteration":"nuzzila","verse_key":"43:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"43:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","en_gloss":"the Quran","transliteration":"l-qur'ānu","verse_key":"43:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"43:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَجُلٍۢ","en_gloss":"a man","transliteration":"rajulin","verse_key":"43:31"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"43:31"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْقَرْيَتَيْنِ","en_gloss":"the two towns","transliteration":"l-qaryatayni","verse_key":"43:31"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَظِيمٍ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmin","verse_key":"43:31"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:31"}]},{"verse_key":"43:32","surah":43,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"أَهُمْ يَقْسِمُونَ رَحْمَتَ رَبِّكَ ۚ نَحْنُ قَسَمْنَا بَيْنَهُم مَّعِيشَتَهُمْ فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا ۚ وَرَفَعْنَا بَعْضَهُمْ فَوْقَ بَعْضٍ دَرَجَـٰتٍ لِّيَتَّخِذَ بَعْضُهُم بَعْضًا سُخْرِيًّا ۗ وَرَحْمَتُ رَبِّكَ خَيْرٌ مِّمَّا يَجْمَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Are they the ones who share out your Lord’s grace? We are the ones who give them their share of livelihood in this world and We have raised some of them above others in rank, so that some may take others into service: your Lord’s grace is better than anything they accumulate.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَهُمْ","en_gloss":"Do they","transliteration":"ahum","verse_key":"43:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَقْسِمُونَ","en_gloss":"distribute","transliteration":"yaqsimūna","verse_key":"43:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَحْمَتَ","en_gloss":"(the) Mercy","transliteration":"raḥmata","verse_key":"43:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبِّكَ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"43:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَحْنُ","en_gloss":"We","transliteration":"naḥnu","verse_key":"43:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَسَمْنَا","en_gloss":"[We] distribute","transliteration":"qasamnā","verse_key":"43:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَيْنَهُم","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"43:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَّعِيشَتَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their livelihood","transliteration":"maʿīshatahum","verse_key":"43:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"43:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥ